hadiths[35]{hadithnumber,text}:
"956","Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ghazwa Tabook mein jumeraat ke din nikley, aur Aap jumeraat ke din nikalna pasand farmatey they. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Sahihain mein aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kam hi nikaltey magar jumeraat ke din."
"957","Sakhr bin Wada'a Ghaamidi Sahaabi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Meri ummat ke liye uske subah ke waqt mein barkat ata farma. Aur Aap jab koi chhota lashkar ya bada lashkar bhejtey to usey din ke shuru mein bhejtey. Aur Sakhr taajir they aur apni tijaarat din ke shuru mein bhejtey, to unka maal badha aur kasrat hui. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"958","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar log tanhai mein wo jaantey jo main jaanta hun to koi sawaar raat mein akela safar na karta. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"959","Amr bin Shuaib se apne walid se apne dada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik sawaar shaitaan hai aur do sawaar do shaitaan hain aur teen sawaar qafila hain. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi aur Nasaai ne sahih asaneed se riwayat kya hai, aur Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"960","Abu Saeed aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab teen safar mein niklein to aik ko apna ameer bana lein. Hasan hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"961","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtreen saathi chaar hain aur behtreen chhota lashkar chaar sau hai aur behtreen bada lashkar chaar hazaar hai, aur baarah hazaar qillat ki wjah se maghloob nahi hongey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"962","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum shadaabi mein safar karo to oonton ko zameen se unka hissa do, aur jab tum qehat mein safar karo to un par tez chalao aur unhey thakney se pehley pahunchayo, aur jab raat mein parhao karo to rastey se bacho, kyonke wo jaanwaron ke rastey hain aur raat mein zehreelay jaanwaron ka thikana hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Iske maana hain: Oonton ko zameen se unka hissa do, yaani unke sath chalne mein narmi karo taake wo chaltey huey charein. Aur uska qaul naqeeha noon ke kasra aur qaaf ke sukoon aur neechey do nuqton wali ya ke sath hai aur wo ghooda hai, iske maana hain: Unhey tez chalayo yahan tak ke manzil tak pahunch jao is se pehley ke unka ghooda sakht chalne se zaaya ho jaey. Aur taarees raat mein utarna hai."
"963","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar mein hotey aur raat mein parhao kartey to daayein taraf late-tey, aur jab subah se pehley parhao kartey to apna baazu khada kartey aur apna sar apni hatheli par rakhtey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Ulema ne kaha: Aap ne apna baazu sirf isliye khada kya taake neend mein doob na jaein aur subah ki namaz waqt se ya awwal waqt se faut na ho."
"964","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat mein chalne ko laazim pakdo, kyonke zameen raat mein lapeti jaati hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai. Dulja raat mein chalna hai."
"965","Abu Saalaba Khushani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Log jab kisi manzil mein utartey to ghaatiyon aur waadiyon mein bikhhar jaatey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tumhara in ghaatiyon aur waadiyon mein bikhharna shaitaan ki taraf se hai! To uske baad wo kisi manzil mein na utartey magar baaz baaz se mil jaatey. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"966","Sehel bin Amr, aur kaha gaya Sehel bin Ar-Rabee bin Amr Ansaari jo Ibn Al-Hanzaliya ke naam se mashhoor hain, aur wo Bait-e-Rizwaan walon mein se hain (Raziallahu anhu), se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik oont par guzrey jis ki kamar uske pait se mil gai thi, to Aap ne farmaya: In be-zabaan jaanwaron mein Allah se daro, un par sawaar ho durust haal mein aur unhey khayo durust haal mein. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"967","Abu Jaafar Abdullah bin Jaafar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey aik din apne peechey sawaar kya aur mujh se aahista aik baat kahi jo main logon mein se kisi se bayan nahi karta, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apni haajat ke liye sab se mehboob parda nishaan ya khajoor ka baagh hota tha, yaani khajoor ki chaar deewaari. Ise is tarah mukhtasar riwayat kya gaya hai. Aur Barqaani ne Muslim ki sanad se khajoor ke baagh ke qaul ke baad izafa kya hai: To Aap Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ke baagh mein dakhil huey to us mein oont tha, phir jab us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to wo roney laga aur uski aankhein beh padhein, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uske paas aey aur uski kohaan aur uske kaan ke peechey masah kya to wo sukoon mein aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Is oont ka maalik kaun hai, ye oont kiska hai? To Ansaar mein se aik ladka aaya aur us ne kaha: Ye mera hai ya Rasulullah. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tu is jaanwar mein Allah se nahi darta jis ka Allah ne tujhey maalik banaya hai? Kyonke wo mujh se shikayat karta hai ke tu usey bhooka rakhta hai aur usey thakaata hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne Barqaani ki riwayat ki tarah riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul zifraah zaal muqta muqta ke kasra aur fa ke sukoon ke sath hai aur wo mufrad muannas lafz hai. Ahl-e-lughat ne kaha: Zifra kaan ke peechey oont ke paseeney ki jagah hai, aur uska qaul tudibuhu yaani tu usey thakaata hai."
"968","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab kisi manzil mein utartey to saamaan kholey baghair nafl na padhtey. Ise Abu Dawud ne Muslim ki shart par sanad se riwayat kya hai. Aur uska qaul la nusabbih yaani ham nafl namaz na padhtey, aur iske maana hain: Ke ham namaz ke shauq ke bawajood usey saamaan utarney aur sawariyon ko aaraam dene par muqaddam nahi kartey."
"969","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba ham safar mein they ke aik aadmi apni sawari par aaya aur apni nigaah daayein baayein phirney laga, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas zaaid sawaari ho to usey us par dey jis ke paas sawaari nahi, aur jis ke paas zaaid tosha ho to usey us par dey jis ke paas tosha nahi. To Aap ne maal ki aqsaam mein se jo zikr kya so zikr kya yahan tak ke ham ne dekha ke ham mein se kisi ka zaaid mein koi haq nahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"970","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne ghazwa ka irada kya aur farmaya: Ae Muhaajireen aur Ansaar ki jamaat! Beshak tumharey bhaiyon mein se kuchh qaum hain jin ke paas na maal hai aur na khaandaan, isliye tum mein se har aik apne sath do ya teen aadmiyon ko mila ley, ham mein se kisi ke paas sawaar honay ke liye uqba ke siwa kuchh nahi, yaani un mein se aik ki baari. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne apne sath do ya teen ko milaya jabke merey paas merey oont ki un mein se aik ki baari ke siwa kuchh na tha. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"971","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein peechey rehtey, phir kamzor ko aagey badhatey aur usey peechey bithatey aur uske liye dua farmatey. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"972","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar ke liye nikal-tey huey apne oont par seedhey baith-tey to teen martaba takbeer kehtey, phir farmatey: Paak hai wo jis ne hamarey liye isey musakhkhar kya aur ham us par qaadir na they, aur beshak ham apne Rab ki taraf laut-ney waley hain. Ae Allah! Beshak ham Tujh se apne is safar mein neki aur taqwa ka sawal kartey hain, aur amal mein se uska jo Tu pasand farmaye. Ae Allah! Ham par hamara ye safar aasaan farma aur uski doori ham se lapet dey. Ae Allah! Tu safar mein saathi hai aur ghar walon mein khalifa hai. Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun safar ki sakhti se aur manzar ki udasi se aur ghar walon aur maal aur aulaad mein burey laut-ney se. Aur jab wapas aatey to yehi kehtey aur un mein izafa farmatey: Laut-ney waley, tauba karne waley, ibaadat karne waley, apne Rab ki hamd karne waley. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Muqrineen ke maana hain: Taaqat rakhne waley. Aur waasaa waao ke fatha aur ain muhmala ke sukoon aur saalisa aur madd ke sath sakhti hai. Aur kaaaba madd ke sath ghum waghera se nafs ka badalna hai. Aur munqalab laut-ney ki jagah hai."
"973","Abdullah bin Sarjis (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar kartey to safar ki sakhti se aur burey laut-ney se aur haasil honay ke baad kami se aur mazloom ki dua se aur ghar walon aur maal mein burey manzar se panah maangtey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Sahih Muslim mein is tarah hai: Al-haur baadal kaun, noon ke sath, aur is tarah Tirmizi aur Nasaai ne riwayat kya hai. Tirmizi ne kaha: Kaur ra ke sath riwayat kya jata hai, aur donon ka wajh hai. Ulema ne kaha: Aur noon aur ra donon ke sath iske maana hain: Seedhey rastey ya zyadati se kami ki taraf laut-na. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ra wali riwayat amaama lapet-ney se li gai hai aur wo usey lapet-na aur jama karna hai, aur noon wali riwayat kaun se hai jo kaana yakoonu kaunan ka masdar hai jab wo paaya gaya aur thehra."
"974","Ali bin Rabee'a se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas haazir tha jab unke paas sawaari laai gai taake us par sawaar hon, phir jab unhon-ne apna paaon rakaab mein rakha to kaha: Allah ke naam se. Phir jab uski peeth par seedhey baith gaey to kaha: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jis ne hamarey liye isey musakhkhar kya aur ham us par qaadir na they, aur beshak ham apne Rab ki taraf laut-ney waley hain. Phir farmaya: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain, teen martaba. Phir farmaya: Allah sab se bara hai, teen martaba. Phir farmaya: Tu paak hai, beshak main ne apni jaan par zulm kya to mujhey bakhsh dey kyonke gunah Tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta. Phir hansey, to kaha gaya: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Tum kis baat par hansey? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne aisa kya jaisa main ne kya, phir Aap hansey, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum kis baat par hansey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tumhara Rab Subhanahu apne bandey par taajjub farmata hai jab wo kahey: Merey gunah bakhsh dey, wo jaanta hai ke uske siwa gunah koi nahi bakhshta. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur baaz nuskhon mein hai: Sahih hadis hai. Aur ye Abu Dawud ka lafz hai."
"975","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab chadhtey to takbeer kehtey aur jab utartey to tasbeeh kehtey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"976","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key lashkar jab bulandiyon par chadhtey to takbeer kehtey aur jab utartey to tasbeeh kehtey. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"977","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Hajj ya Umrah se wapas aatey to jab kabhi bulandi ya sakht zameen par chadhtey to teen martaba takbeer kehtey, phir farmatey: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, usi ke liye baadshahat hai aur usi ke liye hamd hai aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai. Laut-ney waley, tauba karne waley, ibaadat karne waley, sajda karne waley, apne Rab ki hamd karne waley. Allah ne apna waada sach kar dikhaya aur apne bandey ki madad ki aur girohon ko tanha shikast di. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jab lashkaron ya chhotey lashkaron ya Hajj ya Umrah se wapas aatey. Uska qaul aufa yaani buland hua, aur uska qaul fadfad faao ke fatha ke sath hai jinke darmiyaan saakin daal muhmala hai aur aakhir mein doosri daal hai aur wo sakht buland zameen hai."
"978","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main safar ka irada rakhta hun to mujhey waseeyat karein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par taqwa aur har bulandi par takbeer laazim hai. Phir jab wo aadmi peeth pher kar gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Uske liye doori lapet dey aur us par safar aasaan farma. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"979","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath safar mein they, to ham jab kisi waadi par chadhtey to tehleel aur takbeer kehtey aur hamari awazein buland hotin, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logon! Apni jaanon par narmi karo kyonke tum na behrey ko pukaartey ho aur na ghaaib ko. Beshak wo tumharey sath hai, beshak wo sunney wala qareeb hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Irba'u ba muwahhada ke fatha ke sath hai yaani apni jaanon se narmi se pesh aao."
"980","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen duaen maqbool hain un mein koi shak nahi: Mazloom ki dua, aur musaafir ki dua, aur waalid ki apni aulaad par dua. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur Abu Dawud ki riwayat mein ala waladihi nahi hai."
"981","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah jab kisi qaum se dartey to farmatey: Ae Allah! Beshak ham Tujhey unke seenon mein kartey hain aur ham Teri panah maangtey hain unke shuroor se. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasaai ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"982","Khaula bint Hakeem (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo shakhs kisi manzil mein utrey phir kahey: Main Allah ke kaamil kalimaat ki panah maangta hun us shar se jo us ne paida kya, to usey koi chiz nuqsaan nahi pahunchayegi yahan tak ke wo apni us manzil se kooch karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"983","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar kartey aur raat aa jaati to farmatey: Ae zameen! Mera aur tera Rab Allah hai, main Allah ki panah maangta hun terey shar se aur us shar se jo tujh mein hai, aur us shar se jo tujh mein paida kya gaya hai, aur us shar se jo tujh par chalta hai. Main Allah ki panah maangta hun sher aur kaaley saanp ke shar se, aur saanp aur bichhu se, aur sheher ke rehne waley se, aur waalid aur aulaad se. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aswad shakhs hai, Khattaabi ne kaha: Aur saakinul balad se muraad jinn hain jo zameen key rehne waley hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur balad zameen mein se wo hai jo haiwaanon ka thikana ho chaahey us mein imaarat aur manzil na hon. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur muhtamal hai ke waalid se muraad Iblees hai aur ma walad se shayaateen hain."
"984","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Safar azaab ka aik tukda hai, tum mein se har aik ko uske khaaney aur peeney aur soney se rokta hai, phir jab tum mein se koi apne safar se apna maqsad poora kar ley to apne ghar walon ki taraf jaldi aey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Nuhmata uska maqsad hai."
"985","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi lambi ghair haaziri ke baad aey to raat mein apne ghar walon ke paas na aey. Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aadmi ke raat mein apne ghar walon ke paas aaney se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"986","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein apne ghar walon ke paas na aatey, balke unke paas subah ya shaam aatey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Turooq raat mein aana hai."
"987","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aey yahan tak ke jab ham Madina ke peechey they to Aap ne farmaya: Laut-ney waley, tauba karne waley, ibaadat karne waley, apne Rab ki hamd karne waley. To Aap farmatey rahey yahan tak ke ham Madina pahunch gaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"988","Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar se aatey to masjid se shuru farmatey aur us mein do rakaatein padhtey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"989","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us aurat ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par imaan rakhti hai halaal nahi ke aik din aur raat ki musaafat ka safar karey magar apne mehram ke sath. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"990","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Koi mard kisi aurat se tanhai mein na miley magar uske sath mehram ho, aur aurat safar na karey magar mehram ke sath. To aik aadmi ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri biwi Hajj ke liye nikli hai aur main fulaan fulaan ghazwa mein likha gaya hun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jao aur apni biwi ke sath Hajj karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
